OL,5,G1400 Record Review
OL,6,     FAndrew McGregor with a thorough
OL,7,     Flook at the week's classical music
OL,8,     Freleases, plus news and
OL,9,     Frecommendations.
OL,10,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,11,     FEdith Bowman showcases the very
OL,12,     Fbest in screen music. In this
OL,13,     Fweek's special edition, she'll
OL,14,     Ftake a deeper dive into the
OL,15,     F'songwriters of the silver
OL,16,     Fscreen.'.
OL,17,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,18,     FJess Gillam is joined by the
OL,19,     FScottish jazz pianist and composer
OL,20,     FFergus McCreadie for a listening
OL,21,     Fparty, featuring music by Brahms,
OL,22,     FSaariaho and Scott Walker.
