OL,5,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,6,     FLisette Oropesa stars as Alcina
OL,7,     Fand Emily D'Angelo as the knight
OL,8,     FRuggiero in Handel's Alcina - a
OL,9,     Ftale of love, sorcery and betrayal
OL,10,     Fon a magical island.
OL,11,G2130 Music Planet
OL,12,     FLopa Kothari presents the best in
OL,13,     Ffolk and roots-based music from
OL,14,     Faround the world, including a live
OL,15,     Fsession from Belarusian-Polish
OL,16,     Fband Hajda Banda.
