OL,5,G2230 New Music Show
OL,6,     FComposer Daniel Kidane shares his
OL,7,     Fessential listening with Tom
OL,8,     FService. Plus, performances from
OL,9,     Fthe Glasgow Improvisers Orchestra
OL,10,     Fdirected by vibraphonist Orphy
OL,11,     FRobinson.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FMaria Duenas is the soloist with
OL,14,     Fthe Orchestre National de France,
OL,15,     Fconducted by Manfred Honeck. Plus
OL,16,     Forchestral works by Von Suppe,
OL,17,     FJohann Strauss (II) and Josef
OL,18,     FStrauss.
